OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and cloudy start with
OL,6,Flight outbreaks of rain possible by
OL,7,Flate morning. Cloudy with light rain
OL,8,Fpossible through the afternoon. Brisk
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly winds will be strong at
OL,10,Ftimes with coastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with a band of heavy
OL,13,Frain spreading east through the
OL,14,Fevening, accompanied by strong winds
OL,15,Fand severe coastal gales. Rain clears
OL,16,Feast overnight, leaving clear skies
OL,17,Fand easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
