OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA dry morning with
OL,6,Fprolonged sunny spells. A little
OL,7,Fcloudier in the afternoon with bright
OL,8,For sunny intervals and showers
OL,9,Fpossible. Brisk winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday,
OL,13,Fcloudier with rain spreading east in
OL,14,Fthe evening. Mostly cloudy Friday with
OL,15,Frain or showers. Largely dry with
OL,16,Fsunny spells Saturday. Breezy at times.
